mdb.org/t/p/w780/bSMSO9xupd4R4vwTPqigHn2quLN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wL8KA3zIJQPbbU5hJlyIdmmLZit.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a long-awaited trip to Europe, a New York City cop and his hairdresser wife scramble to solve a baffling murder aboard a billionaire's yacht.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":256591,\"title\":\"Focus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lOzGWjceYTd0kd5HyX7Ch46O9kh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cWWM1TTGnOoglZKLpVERGtQ6HJ4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Nicky, an accomplished con artist, gets romantically involved with his disciple Jess but later ends their relationship. Years later, she returns as a femme fatale to spoil his plans.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10833,\"title\":\"Heartbreakers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bwvec0gRMSpLakcPuxe0RWScNv3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ayRhG0eoQwJ6il7bmXGrZx8rUta.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Max and Page are a brilliant mother/daughter con team who have their grift down to a fine science. Max targets wealthy, willing men and marries them. Page then seduces them, and Max catches her husband in the act. Then it's off to palimony city and the next easy mark.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4912,\"title\":\"Confessions of a Dangerous Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mM58ABMRzwn5zVx6BS7IiNK0j3F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLppXa1nKP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16558,\"title\":\"Duplicity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vpWQs3CjwG6Er3DgZlv4L3NFjXg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nmElbl3SyII4gJ8uo1jYYHFjmlK.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two romantically involved government operatives Claire Stenwick and Ray Koval team up to manipulate a race between opposing corporations to corner the market on a medical innovation that will reap huge profits and allow them to lead an extravagant lifestyle together. They find themselves on opposing sides as corporate spies; however, as they each try to outdo the other, neither one can decide how far to trust the other in this high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1218762,\"title\":\"Jingle Bell Heist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rVOQF2Ucekug1B80A9crVx7Jn90.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x8gV0MUZVWkikNZElaBk13vW5f4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two down-on-their-luck hourly workers team up to rob a posh London department store on Christmas Eve. Will they steal each other's hearts along the way?\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Crime\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8952,\"title\":\"I Love You Phillip Morris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/YPxVh9mwKSKNXuLJy3nogtsSUp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGelj98GTvGgx9yq2vNdvRoyXH4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Steven Russell leads a seemingly average life – an organ player in the local church, happily married to Debbie, and a member of the local police force. That is until he has a severe car accident that leads him to the ultimate epiphany: he’s gay and he’s going to live life to the fullest – even if he has to break the law to do it. Taking on an extravagant lifestyle, Steven turns to cons and fraud to make ends meet and is eventually sent to the State Penitentiary where he meets the love of his life, a sensitive, soft-spoken man named Phillip Morris. His devotion to freeing Phillip from jail and building the perfect life together prompts him to attempt (and often succeed at) one impossible con after another.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6073,\"title\":\"The Mexican\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5GqF6rVjUW6CVTuj7w1A2JE49AF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nfG7okcUaUknI8HsDg25eQpQu3L.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jerry Welbach, a reluctant bagman, has been given two ultimatums: The first is from his mob boss to travel to Mexico and retrieve a priceless antique pistol, known as \\\"the Mexican\\\"... or suffer the consequences. The second is from his girlfriend Samantha to end his association with the mob. Jerry figures alive and in trouble with Samantha is better than the more permanent alternative, so he heads south of the border.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333385,\"title\":\"Mr. Right\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aSx5YUCLcSUAR4nt93aeIpZYHF6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ugnGe88pG04SViHpbXbqenzKkOt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A girl falls for the \\\"perfect\\\" guy, who happens to have a very fatal flaw: he's a hitman on the run from the crime cartels who employ him.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9262,\"title\":\"My Mom's New Boyfriend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xV1xnaMk1FCdrdjDolLJYl5SqdI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ovFR1mMSBHN8tzXA3TlyB865WmO.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After several years away, FBI agent Henry Durand returns to find his mother, Marty, a much different person: Having long mourned for Henry's father, she is now embracing single life. One day, while Marty, Henry and his new fiancée, Emily, are out for a walk, they meet Tommy, a mysterious stranger with whom Marty then becomes involved. However, through his FBI contacts, Henry learns that Tommy is suspected of being an art thief. As a young federal agent, Henry is given a difficult assignment: spy on his mother and her boyfriend who is suspected of leading a gang of art thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1262,\"title\":\"Stranger Than Fiction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nCzcepubwShvZ4vbCsygQNgF2Z1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d9eONXYtCmQnPWw61w9pNMGlSzK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Harold Crick is a lonely IRS agent whose mundane existence is transformed when he hears a mysterious voice narrating his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"74cN0TJdjPM\",\"name\":\"Ball of Fire (1941) Official Trailer - Barbara Stanwyck Movie\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}